---
import MainLayout from '../../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout
  title="Small Bodies - Cosmic Atlas | The Astronomy Space"
  description="Explore comets, asteroids, dwarf planets, meteors and other small solar system bodies. Comprehensive guide to the Solar System's lesser-known objects."
>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1 class="hero-title">Small Bodies</h1>
      <p class="hero-subtitle">
        The Solar System's smaller worlds — comets blazing on ancient orbits, asteroids shaped by cosmic collisions,
        dwarf planets hiding in the frozen outer reaches, and meteors streaking through our sky.
      </p>
      <p class="hero-description">
        Select a category below to begin your exploration.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Categories Grid -->
  <section class="categories">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="planet-cards-grid">
            <a href="/atlas/small-bodies/comets/" class="planet-card">
              <div class="planet-card-visual">
                <img src="/images/card_comets.jpg" alt="Comets" class="planet-image" loading="lazy" />
              </div>
              <div class="planet-card-content">
                <h2 class="planet-name">Comets</h2>
                <p class="planet-tagline">Icy Wanderers</p>
              </div>
              <div class="card-arrow">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                  <path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
            </a>

            <a href="/atlas/small-bodies/asteroids/" class="planet-card">
              <div class="planet-card-visual">
                <img src="/images/card_asteroids.jpg" alt="Asteroids" class="planet-image" loading="lazy" />
              </div>
              <div class="planet-card-content">
                <h2 class="planet-name">Asteroids</h2>
                <p class="planet-tagline">Rocky Remnants</p>
              </div>
              <div class="card-arrow">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                  <path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
            </a>

            <a href="/atlas/small-bodies/dwarf-planets/" class="planet-card">
              <div class="planet-card-visual">
                <img src="/images/card_small_dwarf_planets.jpg" alt="Dwarf Planets" class="planet-image" loading="lazy" />
              </div>
              <div class="planet-card-content">
                <h2 class="planet-name">Dwarf Planets</h2>
                <p class="planet-tagline">Small but Round</p>
              </div>
              <div class="card-arrow">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                  <path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
            </a>

            <a href="/atlas/small-bodies/meteors/" class="planet-card">
              <div class="planet-card-visual">
                <img src="/images/card_meteors.jpg" alt="Meteors &amp; Meteorites" class="planet-image" loading="lazy" />
              </div>
              <div class="planet-card-content">
                <h2 class="planet-name">Meteors &amp; Meteorites</h2>
                <p class="planet-tagline">Shooting Stars</p>
              </div>
              <div class="card-arrow">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                  <path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
            </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- About Section -->
  <section class="about">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="about-title">Beyond the Planets</h2>
      <p class="about-text">
        The Solar System contains far more than eight planets. Billions of smaller objects — from mountain-sized
        asteroids to icy comets on million-year journeys — fill the space between and beyond the planets. These
        small bodies are time capsules from the Solar System's formation 4.6 billion years ago, preserving material
        that has barely changed since the Sun first ignited.
      </p>
      <p class="about-text">
        Some of these objects have shaped the history of life on Earth. Comets may have delivered water and organic
        molecules to the young planet. Asteroid impacts have triggered mass extinctions and created craters that are
        still visible today. And dwarf planets like Pluto have proven to be surprisingly complex worlds with
        mountains, plains, and even possible subsurface oceans.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>

<style>
  /* Hero Section */
  .hero {
    padding: 6rem 0 4rem 0;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 8vw, 4rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem 0;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    color: white;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .hero-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
    max-width: 40rem;
    margin: 0 auto 1.5rem auto;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .hero-description {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Categories Grid */
  .categories {
    padding: 2rem 0 4rem 0;
  }

  .planet-cards-grid {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  /* Responsive Grid Layout */
  .planet-cards-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-md);
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .planet-cards-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: var(--space-lg);
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .planet-cards-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    }
  }

  /* Individual Planet Card */
  .planet-card {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    padding: var(--space-lg);
    background: #010101;
    border: var(--glass-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
    cursor: pointer;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .planet-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.05) 0%, transparent 100%);
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 0.4s ease;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  /* Hover Effects */
  .planet-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-8px) scale(1.02);
    border-color: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.3);
    box-shadow:
      0 8px 32px rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.15),
      0 0 0 1px rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.1);
  }

  .planet-card:hover::before {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .planet-card:active {
    transform: translateY(-6px) scale(1.01);
  }

  /* Focus state for accessibility */
  .planet-card:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--color-accent-cyan);
    outline-offset: 4px;
    border-color: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.4);
  }

  /* Planet Visual Icon */
  .planet-card-visual {
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
    min-height: 120px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .planet-image {
    width: 110px;
    height: 110px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
    transition: all 0.4s ease;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
  }

  .planet-card:hover .planet-image {
    transform: scale(1.15) rotate(5deg);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
  }

  /* Planet Card Content */
  .planet-card-content {
    text-align: center;
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .planet-name {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    transition: color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .planet-card:hover .planet-name {
    color: var(--color-accent-cyan);
  }

  .planet-tagline {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    transition: color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .planet-card:hover .planet-tagline {
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  /* Card Arrow Indicator */
  .card-arrow {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: var(--space-sm);
    right: var(--space-sm);
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    color: var(--color-accent-cyan);
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateX(-8px);
    transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
  }

  .card-arrow svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .planet-card:hover .card-arrow {
    opacity: 0.7;
    transform: translateX(0);
  }

  /* Responsive Adjustments */
  @media (max-width: 639px) {
    .planet-card {
      padding: var(--space-md);
    }

    .planet-image {
      width: 90px;
      height: 90px;
    }

    .planet-card-visual {
      min-height: 100px;
    }

    .planet-name {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }

    .planet-tagline {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
    }

    .planet-nav-subtitle {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      padding: 0 var(--space-sm);
    }
  }

  /* Page Load Animation */
  @keyframes fadeInUp {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(20px);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }

  .planet-card {
    animation: fadeInUp 0.6s ease backwards;
  }

  /* Stagger animation for each card */
  .planet-card:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: 0.1s; }
  .planet-card:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.15s; }
  .planet-card:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.2s; }
  .planet-card:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 0.25s; }
  .planet-card:nth-child(5) { animation-delay: 0.3s; }
  .planet-card:nth-child(6) { animation-delay: 0.35s; }
  .planet-card:nth-child(7) { animation-delay: 0.4s; }
  .planet-card:nth-child(8) { animation-delay: 0.45s; }

  /* Reduce Motion Support */
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .planet-card {
      animation: none;
    }

    .planet-card,
    .planet-image,
    .card-arrow {
      transition-duration: 0.1s;
    }
  }

  /* About Section */
  .about {
    padding: 4rem 0 6rem 0;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  }

  .about .container {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .about-title {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: white;
    margin: 0 0 2rem 0;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  }

  .about-text {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem 0;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .about-text:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
</style>
